     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Tanesha has experienced domestic and intimate partner trauma, and the shelter may ignite fear related to a possible recurrence. Nutritional and sleep assessments are also important. She has not shown signs of potential suicide risk."
    }
